{#
  The « Courrier » box (Booking\BookingBox::MAIL). Rendered on the Courrier
  page, open there; its body is `_communications.html.twig`.

  The one box that is not always there. What decides it — `inbound_mail`
  enabled, a mailbox configured — is not something a button on the page can
  change, so the controller settles it once: without it the page does not
  exist and its chip is absent (§7.7). A box that could only ever be empty
  is noise.

  Optional: `open` — the box arrives unfolded.
#}
<div class="card mb-3" id="{{ boxes.mail.anchor }}">
    {% embed '@rental/management/_dossier_header.html.twig' with {
        box: boxes.mail, target_id: boxes.mail.bodyAnchor, messages: messages, open: open|default(false),
    } only %}
        {% block figure %}
            <span class="text-body-secondary small" data-booking-panel="communications-figure">
                {{ messages is empty
                    ? 'Aucun message'
                    : messages|length ~ ' message' ~ (messages|length > 1 ? 's' : '') }}
            </span>
        {% endblock %}
    {% endembed %}
    <div class="collapse{{ open|default(false) ? ' show' }}" id="{{ boxes.mail.bodyAnchor }}">
        <div data-booking-panel="communications">
            {% include '@rental/management/_communications.html.twig' %}
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
